SUMMARY: Brown County Art Guild presents the T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibit
 ion
DESCRIPTION:T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibition\n\nJuly 3 – September 4\, 202
 6\n\nBrown County Art Guild\n\nThe T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibition at the
  Brown County Art Guild commemorates the 100th anniversary of Steele’s pa
 ssing and honors his enduring artistic legacy in Brown County from 1907 t
 o 1926. This special exhibition features a remarkable collection of lands
 capes\, floral still lifes\, and portraiture from regional museums\, publ
 ic libraries\, and private collections—celebrating the beauty\, light\, a
 nd spirit that inspired one of Indiana’s most beloved painters.\n\n------
 -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 -----\n\nBrown County Art Guild – A not for profit organization located i
 n the heart of downtown Nashville\, Indiana. On display throughout its ga
 lleries is a prized collection of historic paintings as well as current w
 orks for sale from regional award-winning member artists. The Guild also 
 offers artist demonstrations\, workshops\, and a variety of events or pro
 grams throughout the year.\n\nVisit our website: http://browncountyartgui
 ld.org or call 812-9088-6185 for more information\n\nHours: March – Decem
 ber\, Monday – Saturday 11am-5pm & Sundays 12-4pm\n\nWinter Hours: Januar
 y & February\, Thursday – Saturday 11am-5pm & Sundays 12-4pm
CATEGORIES:Nashville,Visual-Arts,Free
