SUMMARY: Unreferencing Fields 3.X by Charles R Pearce
DESCRIPTION:Unreferencing Fields 3.x by Charles R. Pearce explores digita
 l art beyond traditional screens and commercial media. Through movement\,
  composition\, color\, and rhythm\, Pearce’s work invites viewers to cons
 ider digital imagery in a new way\, free from the expectations of adverti
 sing and communication.\n\nWith over 15 years of experience in music vide
 o\, television\, and commercial media\, Pearce brings a unique perspectiv
 e to his experimental digital practice. Based in Bloomington\, he is the 
 Executive Director of Pillar Arts and founder of the Bloomington Motion A
 rtists Group.\n\nExhibition Details\n📍 Pillar Arts Alliance Center\n\n🗓
 ️ August 1–29\n🎉 Closing Reception: Saturday\, August 29\, 6–8 PM\n\nJoi
 n us to meet the artist\, enjoy light refreshments\, and celebrate the ex
 hibition with the arts community.
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Exhibition,Free,In-Person,Gallery,Visual-Arts
