SUMMARY: The Piano (1993) 4K Restoration
DESCRIPTION:After a long voyage from Scotland\, pianist Ada McGrath (Holl
 y Hunter) and her young daughter\, Flora (Anna Paquin)\, are left with al
 l their belongings\, including a piano\, on a New Zealand beach. Ada\, wh
 o has been mute since childhood\, has been sold into marriage to a local 
 man named Alisdair Stewart (Sam Neill). Making little attempt to warm up 
 to Alisdair\, Ada soon becomes intrigued by his Maori-friendly acquaintan
 ce\, George Baines (Harvey Keitel)\, leading to tense\, life-altering con
 flicts.\n\nJane Campion’s 1993 Palme d’Or-winning classic The Piano has r
 eceived a stunning 4K restoration\, featuring Dolby Vision HDR.\nSupervis
 ed by Campion and cinematographer Stuart Dryburgh\, it was scanned from t
 he original 35mm negative.\n\nRATING: R\n\nRUNTIME: 2hrs 1min\n\nFORMAT: 
 Digitally Restored 4K DCP
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Film
