SUMMARY: Artist Talk and Demonstration Catherine Baum-Newlin
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for a creative Saturday afternoon with local a
 rtist\, Catherine Baum-Newlin. She will give a demonstration and take you
 r questions while we watch her create!\n\nThe Artist will share what best
  illustrates a process of ‘creating’ that she finds helpful.\n\nShe says\
 , “Art practice is like practicing my violin\, fast writes in writing pra
 ctice\, or showing up to meditate. First\, just show up and be present. N
 ext\, ‘play’ comes along with elements of curiosity\, noticing\, and obse
 rving. ‘Allowing’ enters and\, with that\, a deeper ‘you’ shows up. Thoug
 hts\, sounds\, words\, images are present. Good or bad becomes irrelevant
 . I almost always feel I’m learning.”\n\nIn the demo\, she will do a ‘pla
 y’ page in her notebook\, paint some washi papers\, make some marks and w
 e’ll see what happens! This is sure to be an experimental\, fun\, and pla
 yful afternoon!\n\n
CATEGORIES:Free,Visual-Arts
