SUMMARY: Brown County Art Guild - New Exhibitions pARTy!
DESCRIPTION:Brown County Art Guild\n\nNew Exhibitions pARTy\n\nGallery Re
 ception Celebrating New Exhibitions\n\nSaturday August 8\, 2026\n\n2-4 pm
 \n\nCelebrate summer with the Brown County Art Guild at our New Exhibitio
 ns pARTy! Explore new artwork by our Guild Artist Members in the Guild Ar
 tist Exhibition & Sale\, along with their special exhibition\, The Art of
  Brown County – Scenes & Views\, showcasing the beauty\, landscapes\, and
  iconic scenes of Brown County. Guests can also view the exceptional hist
 oric exhibition\, T.C. Steele Memorial Exhibition\, honoring one of India
 na's most beloved artists. Enjoy an afternoon of art\, music\, meet the a
 rtists\, and enjoy complimentary refreshments as we celebrate creativity 
 at the Guild.\n\n________________________________________________________
 _____________________\n\nBrown County Art Guild – A not for profit organi
 zation located in the heart of downtown Nashville\, Indiana. On display t
 hroughout its galleries is a prized collection of historic paintings as w
 ell as current works for sale from regional award-winning member artists.
  Also offered throughout the year are artist demonstrations\, workshops\,
  and special exhibits.\n\nGallery hours March through December 2026: Mond
 ay – Saturday\, 11 – 5 and Sunday\, 12 – 4\n\nIf you would like additiona
 l information\, please call 812.988.6185 or view our website https://brow
 ncountyartguild.org/ https://browncountyartguild.org/
CATEGORIES:Exhibition,Free,Gallery,Nashville
