SUMMARY: Artist Is In - Guild Artist Demonstration Series - Luke Buck
DESCRIPTION:Artist Is In - Guild Artist Demonstration Series\n\nA favorit
 e every year\, select Guild artists will demonstrate their techniques and
  creative process in the gallery\, offering visitors a chance to watch ar
 t being made firsthand. Each artist will present a different medium\, pro
 viding a unique glimpse into the range of possibilities using various art
 istic methods and materials.\n\nLuke Buck – Watercolor & Whiskey\n\nSatur
 day – August 15\, 2026\n\n1-3pm.\n\nFREE!\n\nJoin Guild Artist Member\, L
 uke Buck for a fascinating demonstration exploring his unique watercolor 
 and whiskey technique. Luke will create a painting live while discussing 
 his artistic process\, inspiration\, and approach to the medium. This fre
 e event is open to the public and offers a wonderful opportunity to learn
  from one of the Guild's talented artists. And if you're familiar with Lu
 ke's work\, you'll know he sometimes hides a red cardinal within his pain
 tings—see if you can spot one this time!\n\n-----------------------------
 ------------------------------------------------------\n\nBrown County Ar
 t Guild – A not for profit organization located in the heart of downtown 
 Nashville\, Indiana. On display throughout its galleries is a prized coll
 ection of historic paintings as well as current works for sale from regio
 nal award-winning member artists. Also offered throughout the year are ar
 tist demonstrations\, workshops\, and special exhibits.\n\nGallery hours 
 March through December 2026\, Monday – Saturday\, 11 – 5 and Sunday\, 12 
 – 4 or by appointment.\n\nIf you would like more information\, call 812.9
 88.6185 or visit our web site https://browncountyartguild.org/ https://br
 owncountyartguild.org/
CATEGORIES:Visual-Arts,Nashville,In-Person,Free
