 e every year\, select Guild artists will demonstrate their techniques and
  creative process in the gallery\, offering visitors a chance to watch ar
 t being made firsthand. Each artist will present a different medium\, pro
 viding a unique glimpse into the range of possibilities using various art
 istic methods and materials.\n\nPamela Newell – Pastel\n\nSunday – August
  16\, 2026\n\n1-3pm\n\nFREE!\n\nJoin Guild Artist Pamela Newell for a fre
 e pastel demonstration and discover the beauty of this vibrant and expres
 sive medium. Learn how colors are layered\, blended\, and mixed to create
  rich\, luminous works of art. Pamela will share insights into the pastel
  materials she loves most\, discuss her creative process\, and answer que
 stions from attendees. From stunning garden scenes inspired by her own la
 ndscapes to beautiful views captured during her travels in France\, Pamel
 a’s artwork showcases the versatility of pastel.\n\n---------------------
 -------------------------------------------------------------------------
