SUMMARY: Legally Blonde | Additional Films and Guests
DESCRIPTION:Elle Woods (Reese Witherspoon) is a California blonde with co
 uture clothes (mostly pink\, obvs)\, fabulous friends\, and the hottest b
 oyfriend on campus. So when Warner Huntington III (Matthew Davis) suddenl
 y dumps her and heads to Harvard Law School\, Elle takes matters into her
  own manicured hands and enrolls as well. Now\, getting Warner back shoul
 d be a snap (well\, maybe a bend and snap)\, right? Wrong! Elle's about t
 o begin the toughest fight of her life ... for love\, honor\, justice\, a
 nd respect for blondes everywhere! Luke Wilson\, Selma Blair\, Victor Gar
 ber\, Holland Taylor\, and Jennifer Coolidge round out a fantastic ensemb
 le cast. [96 min\; comedy\, romantic comedy\, satire\; English]
CATEGORIES:
