SUMMARY: Tandem's Tea Party Gala
DESCRIPTION:Join Tandem at the Monroe County History Center on Sunday\, A
 ugust 23 from 2-5 pm for our first ever Tea Party Gala! Enjoy live music\
 , refreshments\, and activities like face painting\, tiara crafting\, and
  cake tasting- all while supporting families in your community. A silent 
 action of themed gift baskets includes: Explore Brown County\, Wine and C
 heese night\, Spa Day\, and more!\n\nThe dress code is "Tea Party Fancy"-
  whatever that means to you. Wear anything from a princess dress to jeans
 . It's whatever YOU feel "fancy" in.\n\nTickets can be bought individuall
 y or by table. Sponsorship tables are available.\n\nIf you are interested
  in sponsoring the event or a table as a business\, organization or famil
 y\, please use this link: Tandem Tea Party Sponsorship https://forms.offi
 ce.com/r/W9x9XmNNtb .\n\nKids are encouraged to join! If your child will 
 sit exclusively in your lap\, they do not need their own ticket. Any chil
 d who will want their own seat needs their own ticket.\n\nEarly Bird Pric
 ing Ends August 1st!
