SUMMARY: CatVideoFest 2026 | CINEkids International Children's Film Serie
 s
DESCRIPTION:CatVideoFest is a joyous\, communal theatrical experience fea
 turing the latest and best cat videos\, while raising money for cats in n
 eed through partnerships with local charities\, animal welfare organizati
 ons\, and shelters. CatVideoFest is committed to raising awareness and mo
 ney for cats in need all around the world\, and each CVF event’s charitab
 le component is local. Since 2019\, CatVideoFest has raised over $1 milli
 on in financial contributions and have facilitated adoptions\, fostering\
 , volunteer sign-ups\, and much more. CatVideoFest is family-friendly and
  can be enjoyed by anyone! [70 min\; comedy\, action\, drama\; English]\n
 \nIU Cinema’s CatVideoFest 2026 screening supports the Monroe County Huma
 ne Association (MCHA). Since 1956\, MCHA has embodied hope and compassion
  for animals and their human companions throughout Monroe County and its 
 surrounding regions. With a legacy rich in heartfelt service and impactfu
 l change spanning more than six decades\, MCHA steadfastly remains a sanc
 tuary of support\, kindness\, and proactive care for animals in their mos
 t vulnerable times.\n\nBe a part of CatVideoFest 2026 at IU Cinema by doi
 ng one (or all!) of the following:\n\n1. Want to see your cat on IU Cinem
 a’s big screen? So do we! Submit photos of your feline friends https://do
 cs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfNBREZeUCSeQNPGQC1MxUg51O9Fwc0c2qmjp01J2P
 7JQSjXA/viewform by August 19\, and then be sure to arrive early for CatV
 ideoFest 2026 to see patron-submitted cat photos during our pre-screening
  slideshow!\n\n2. Discover how else you can support MCHA by visiting the 
 Monroe County Humane Association website https://www.monroehumane.org/ an
 d see the myriad ways you can be a part of helping their mission!\n\n3. G
 et creative! We will have CatVideoFest coloring pages on hand before our 
 screening for folks who want to arrive early for some kitty-inspired craf
 t time. You can also download CatVideoFest coloring sheets here https://s
 tore.oscilloscope.net/products/catvideofest-coloring-pages and decorate a
 t home!
