SUMMARY: "Flowers & Harmony" by Kwang Cha Brown Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:Explore the bold beauty of nature in Flowers & Harmony\, a ne
 w exhibition featuring the work of Kwang Cha Brown. Using a palette knife
  and richly colored paints\, Brown creates textured\, three-dimensional f
 lorals that capture the beauty of the natural world through broken color 
 and dramatic layering.\n\nHer technique combines thick\, tactile layers o
 f paint with elements of pointillism\, resulting in work that feels both 
 vivid and dimensional\, inviting viewers to experience flowers in a whole
  new way.\n\n📅 Exhibition Dates: September 1–October 26\n🎉 Artist Recep
 tions: Friday\, September 4 and Friday\, October 2\n🕔 Reception Time: 5:
 00–8:00 PM\, during Gallery Walk\n📍 Location: By Hand Gallery\, Fountain
  Square
