SUMMARY: Come and Sing! Auditions for the Bloomington Chamber Singers
DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Chamber Singers is a 40-voice chorus and is invit
 ing experienced singers to audition for our 2026–2027 season. We are seek
 ing singers in all voice parts who are interested in joining our communit
 y for an exciting season of music-making.\n\nThis season is not one to mi
 ss – music from Bach to the Beatles\, the Nunes Garcia Requiem (which wil
 l be recorded)\, The Notebooks of Leonardo da Vinci\, a modern American w
 ork for choir\, chamber ensemble\, and projections and of course our trad
