 xhibition featuring the artists of Upland Plein Air. This friendly\, incl
 usive community of painters creates work directly inspired by the landsca
 pes of south central Indiana—from parks and forests to historic sites and
  charming neighborhoods—capturing each scene's light and atmosphere in th
 e moment.\n\nWorking in oil\, watercolor\, pastels\, and more\, this grou
 p of artists ranging from beginners to professionals brings a wide variet
 y of styles and perspectives to the show\, united by a shared love of pai
 nting from life and exploring the beauty found throughout our region.\n\n
 📅 Exhibition Dates: September 3–29\n🎉 Artist Reception: Saturday\, Sept
 ember 12\n🕔 Reception Time: 3:00–5:00 PM\n📍 Location: Arts Alliance Cen
 ter\, College Mall
