SUMMARY: Not One Less w/Q&A | For All the Children
DESCRIPTION:Wei Minzhi\, a 13‑year‑old substitute teacher\, must cover a 
 village school for one month and will not receive her salary if any of th
 e students drop out. When a boy leaves to seek work in a nearby city\, We
 i follows to bring him back. Shot in a neorealist\, documentary style\, t
 he film uses non-professional actors playing versions of themselves\, blu
 rring the line between fiction and lived reality through simplicity\, res
 traint\, and careful observation of community. [106 min\; drama\; Mandari
 n with English subtitles]\n\nA Q&A will follow the screening.
CATEGORIES:
