SUMMARY: Resurrection/Kuang ye shi dai | Arthouse Now
DESCRIPTION:In a future where humanity has surrendered its ability to dre
 am in exchange for immortality\, an outcast finds illusion\, nightmarish 
 visions\, and beauty in an intoxicating world of his own making. A work o
 f staggering imagination unfolding in five chapters that encompass everyt
 hing from silent-era expressionism to film noir to a delirious vampire lo
 ve story shot in one of Bi Gan’s signature long takes\, Resurrection is v
 isionary Chinese director Bi’s (Long Day's Journey Into Night) work of br
 eathtaking imagination wherein cinema is the ultimate portal to the uncon
 scious mind. [160 min\; drama\, sci-fi\; Chinese and Mandarin with Englis
 h subtitles]
