SUMMARY: Reality Bites | Soundtracks of a Generation
DESCRIPTION:This irreverent look at the harsh realities of life after col
 lege captures the misadventures of Lelaina (Winona Ryder)\, an aspiring T
 V production assistant and burgeoning reality-television creator\, and he
 r relationships with her sarcastic roommate Vickie (Janeane Garofalo)\, f
 riends Sammy (Steve Zahn) and Troy (Ethan Hawke)\, and an ambitious video
  executive\, Michael (Ben Stiller). Reality Bites captures that nebulous 
 period between college and the rest of your life with an endless supply o
 f evergreen quotes about life\, love\, and the pursuit of gainful employm
 ent. Premiering at the Sundance Film Festival in 1994\, smack-dab in the 
 midst of the fest's indie filmmaking heyday\, and riding high on the '70s
  nostalgia of the '90s\, Reality Bites and its accompanying soundtrack is
  a comedic and cultural touchstone encapsulating Generation X's slacker/g
 rind culture with pitch perfection. [99 min\; comedy\, drama\; English]
