SUMMARY: Cronos | Friday Night Frights
DESCRIPTION:Antiques dealer Jesús Gris stumbles across Cronos\, a 400-yea
 r-old scarab that\, when it latches onto him\, grants him youth\, eternal
  life—and a thirst for blood. As Jesús enjoys his newfound vitality\, he'
 s unaware that a dying old man has sent his nephew to find the scarab and
  bring it back to him. But Jesús will not give immortality up easily. [94
  min\; horror\; Spanish with English subtitles]
