SUMMARY: Coyote vs Acme (2026)
DESCRIPTION:Coyote vs Acme (2026)\nAfter Acme products fail him one too m
 any times in his dogged pursuit of the Roadrunner\, Wile E. Coyote decide
 s to hire a billboard lawyer (Will Forte) to sue the Acme Corporation.\n\
 nA growing friendship between Coyote and Kevin motivates their determinat
 ion to win the court case\, as it pits them against Buddy Crane\, the int
 imidating boss of Kevin’s former law firm\, who now represents Acme.\n\nB
 ased on “Coyote v. Acme” by Ian Frazier\n\nStarring: Will Forte\, Lana Co
 ndor\, Tone Bell\, John Cena\n\nDirected by Dave Green\nScreenplay by Sam
 y Burch\n\nRated: PG\nLength: 1hr 50mins\nFormat: DCP
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Film
