SUMMARY: Tomorrow's Sentry
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow’s Sentry: One forgotten trunk. One extraordinary lif
 e. One community’s untold story.\n\nWhen 102-year-old Bloomington residen
 t Dot Weaver dies\, she left behind fragments of a hidden history waiting
  to be discovered. Audiences are taken on an unforgettable journey though
  Monroe County’s controversial history — from the post Civil War era to t
 oday. Filled with celebrations\, overdue realizations\, and lessons for f
 uture generations\, Tomorrow’s Sentry reminds us that today’s youth will 
 become tomorrow’s guardians of history.
