SUMMARY: A Foreigner's Journey to Boston
DESCRIPTION:Experience the magic of three legendary bands—Foreigner\, Jou
 rney\, and Boston—brought to life by a powerhouse tribute group. Fronted 
 by Brandon Miller\, touring guitarist of the Artimus Pyle Band and Rock a
 nd Roll Hall of Fame drummer of Lynyrd Skynyrd\, A Foreigner’s Journey to
  Boston delivers the iconic hits that defined a generation.\n\nWith a set
 list spanning the greatest hits of Foreigner\, Journey\, and Boston\, thi
 s band brings the energy\, passion\, and nostalgia of classic rock to eve
 ry performance.\n\n“Don’t Stop Believing” — “More Than a Feeling” — “I Wa
 nna Know What Love Is” — AND SO MUCH MORE!
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Music
