SUMMARY: An Enemy of the State
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “An Enemy of the People
 ” on stage February 4th-21st at the Waldron Auditorium.\n\n\nThis Tony-no
 minated adaptation of Henrik Ibsen’s masterpiece follows a small-town doc
 tor who discovers a catastrophe that risks the lives of everyone in town.
  After raising the alarm\, he is shaken to his core as those in power\, i
 ncluding his own brother\, not only try to silence him—they try to destro
 y him.\n\n\nSee Constellation’s website for more information\, including 
 a detailed performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at seeconste
 llation.org/mainstage/enemy-of-the-people/ https://seeconstellation.org/m
 ainstage/enemy-of-the-people/
