SUMMARY: 34th Annual Indiana Heritage Quilt Show
DESCRIPTION:Indiana Heritage Quilt Show brings together quilt lovers for 
 three days of inspiration\, education\, and community. Over 200 quilts on
  display\, workshops by nationally known instructors are offered\, vendor
 s selling fiber art related wares\, and special exhibits make this a must
 -see event. Free parking and onsite food available. Additional quilt rela
 ted exhibits at off-site venues.
CATEGORIES:Bloomington,Visual-Arts,Workshop
